1
00:00:00,577 --> 00:00:02,406
Now, in order to make sure that these

2
00:00:02,518 --> 00:00:05,839
buttons do something, we need to listen to

3
00:00:06,272 --> 00:00:08,021
events on these buttons.

4
00:00:09,480 --> 00:00:11,951
And there again would be different ways of

5
00:00:11,983 --> 00:00:13,058
handling events here.

6
00:00:13,972 --> 00:00:16,266
We could add hx-on here

7
00:00:16,860 --> 00:00:18,849
to add an event listener, and we can then

8
00:00:18,945 --> 00:00:21,063
also listen to standard events as you

9
00:00:21,063 --> 00:00:22,282
learned, like the click event.

10
00:00:23,453 --> 00:00:25,218
And then we could specify the code that

11
00:00:25,218 --> 00:00:27,111
should be executed here. But this is

12
00:00:27,208 --> 00:00:29,151
actually not the approach I'll use here.

13
00:00:29,552 --> 00:00:32,330
Instead, after inserting this dialog into

14
00:00:32,346 --> 00:00:34,192
the document and after selecting it,

15
00:00:34,754 --> 00:00:36,745
I will select this No button.

16
00:00:37,339 --> 00:00:38,238
So the button that should

17
00:00:38,848 --> 00:00:41,224
close the dialog and not do anything else

18
00:00:41,594 --> 00:00:43,456
since we already canceled the event.

19
00:00:44,146 --> 00:00:46,137
And I'll get hold of this No button by using

20
00:00:46,234 --> 00:00:48,016
document.getElementById.

21
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:51,853
And then conveniently this button has this

22
00:00:51,949 --> 00:00:52,271
ID.

23
00:00:55,831 --> 00:00:57,414
Action-no. So I'll use that here

24
00:00:58,912 --> 00:00:59,335
like this.

25
00:01:01,957 --> 00:01:02,905
And then we can add

26
00:01:03,563 --> 00:01:05,315
an event listener to this no button

27
00:01:06,311 --> 00:01:08,287
and listen for the click event. And when

28
00:01:08,319 --> 00:01:11,018
that event occurs in that function that will

29
00:01:11,115 --> 00:01:12,360
get triggered for that event,

30
00:01:12,976 --> 00:01:15,274
I wanna close my dialog

31
00:01:16,132 --> 00:01:19,079
or to be precise, I wanna remove the dialog

32
00:01:19,143 --> 00:01:19,759
from the DOM.

33
00:01:21,225 --> 00:01:22,303
And therefore I'll simply call

34
00:01:22,432 --> 00:01:25,345
dialog.remove, which will remove that dialog

35
00:01:25,474 --> 00:01:27,517
element from the DOM and therefore it will

36
00:01:27,517 --> 00:01:28,837
of course also be closed.

37
00:01:31,906 --> 00:01:33,197
So if we save that,

38
00:01:34,181 --> 00:01:36,473
if I reload, click an item and click no,

39
00:01:37,070 --> 00:01:39,878
this dialog gets closed. If I click another

40
00:01:39,894 --> 00:01:41,587
element again, it gets opened again and I

41
00:01:41,587 --> 00:01:43,601
can close it. So that works.

42
00:01:44,567 --> 00:01:46,549
But how do we now handle this yes button?
